36
00:02:19,380 --> 00:02:22,498
Because there's about to be
an avalanche, that's why!

37
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:29,440
It's Wapol!

38
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:32,397
Wapol and his men have
come back to the island!

39
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:33,310
