41
00:02:34,306 --> 00:02:36,232
Dalton headed up to Bighorn to meet them.

42
00:02:36,420 --> 00:02:39,714
Anyone who can fight, grab a
weapon and head to Bighorn.

43
00:02:39,860 --> 00:02:40,801
Hurry, everyone!

44
00:02:40,900 --> 00:02:42,757
Get your weapons and head for Bighorn!

45
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:44,460
Follow Dalton all the way!

46
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:46,600
Follow Dalton to Bighorn!

47
00:02:46,820 --> 00:02:47,997
Waple's back on the island!

48
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:49,492
Everyone arm yourselves!

49
00:02:49,780 --> 00:02:51,517
We're going to protect our country!

50
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:52,430
Get a weapon!

51
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:54,460
March to Bighorn! Yeah!

52
