73
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:40,397
At any rate, if we keep to this route,

74
00:03:40,480 --> 00:03:43,377
we should see a sign for this
piasta place somewhere along it.

75
00:03:43,460 --> 00:03:44,477
Keep your eyes open.

76
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:45,390
Sure thing.

77
00:03:45,473 --> 00:03:46,303
Just leave it to me.

78
00:03:46,386 --> 00:03:48,042
I'll watch for signs of the sun.

79
00:03:48,440 --> 00:03:50,087
There's no way I'll miss it.

80
