or have you forgotten?

145
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:34,960
I haven't forgotten.

146
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:37,417
It's true that while you were
making our people suffer,

147
00:06:37,500 --> 00:06:39,177
or all I could do is stand there as one of

148
