and you aren't a real king!

174
00:07:49,760 --> 00:07:52,348
Well, you certainly
speak your mind, Dalton.

175
00:07:52,580 --> 00:07:53,410
Now kill him!

176
00:07:53,500 --> 00:07:55,853
