177
00:07:56,460 --> 00:07:59,401
As usual, you don't
understand a thing I'm saying.

178
00:08:04,220 --> 00:08:06,537
I served your father before
you And he was always

179
00:08:06,620 --> 00:08:09,197
a good man and a fair
ruler I hoped you might

180
00:08:09,280 --> 00:08:11,377
come to resemble him one
day But I see now that

181
00:08:11,460 --> 00:08:13,937
that was a lot of wishful
thinking Not good,

182
00:08:14,020 --> 00:08:16,902
he's using the ox ox fruit
He's in his bison form

183
00:08:18,180 --> 00:08:20,100
Don't back down, just fire him

184
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:28,480
We can't hit him He just dodges
No mercy, even to my ex-soldiers

185
