Dalton, wait!

197
00:09:04,860 --> 00:09:05,957
We've come to help you!

198
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:07,737
Please let us fight with you!

199
00:09:07,820 --> 00:09:09,879
We're going to protect our country!

200
