Remember, I've known you a long time.

201
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:20,860
And I know you well.

202
00:09:21,420 --> 00:09:22,250
No, don't!

203
00:09:22,333 --> 00:09:24,182
I know what your weaknesses are.

204
00:09:37,540 --> 00:09:40,720
Oh no, why did you shield
us from that shot? Dalton!

205
00:09:44,460 --> 00:09:45,500
Are you alright?

206
00:09:45,940 --> 00:09:48,457
I told you I knew where
your weak spot was.

207
00:09:48,540 --> 00:09:50,500
